# Tek seferlik gelistirme betikleri ve gecici dokumler.
# Bunlar yeniden uretim paketinin parcasi degildir; depoya ve release'e girmemeleri
# gerekir. Ozellikle manuscript veya model dosyalarini yerinde degistiren betikler
# (update_makale.py, rewrite_pickle.py) yayimlandiginda sonuclarin sonradan
# duzenlendigi izlenimi verir.
fix_*.py
patch_*.py
deploy_*.py
edit_makale.py
update_makale.py
rewrite_pickle.py
check_hist.py
check_probs.py
extract_tables.py

# Gecici metin dokumleri
conclusion_dump.txt
abstract_dump.txt
temp_article*.txt
manuscript_audit_text.txt
table5.txt
*.bak
makale.html.onceki

# Frames extracted from the clip corpus by extract_training_frames.py. The
# corpus itself is excluded above and one of its two sources is CC BY-NC, so
# the derived frames are not redistributed either; rerun the extractor to
# rebuild them from a local copy of the corpus.
Proje_Kodlari/data/dataset/

# Re-creatable intermediates of the image-level experiments of Sections 4.1-4.4.
# The aggregate JSON and CSV in the same directory ARE part of the release; only
# the decode cache and the per-image checkpoints are rebuilt on demand.
**/_sweep_frames_*.npy
**/_sweep_frames_*.progress
**/_v1_*_perimage*.jsonl

# Stray git template directory, not the repository's own .git
git/

# Internal audit notes, not part of the reproduction package
TUTARLILIK_RAPORU.md

# Stray screen recording, not referenced by any experiment
Proje_Kodlari/rec_*.mp4

# Internal review notes, not part of the reproduction package
HAKEM_RAPORU.md

# Checkpoint of the box-stage diagnostic; the aggregate JSON beside it is released
**/_v1_box_stages.jsonl

# Per-seed artifacts of the seed sweep; the aggregate v3_seed_variance.json is released
**/_seed_runs.json
**/_clip_verdicts_seed*.json
**/_v3_results_seed*.json
**/v3_mobilenet_seed*.pth

